/code-review high — loop U4, round 1, range b0696c8..2b5d8c9

I found 8 issues in the branch `2026-10-21-packs-gap-fixes` (`main...HEAD`, excluding the plan docs). The two most important:

- **Wrong folder in the android task.** The shipped android task still tells consumers to put their values in `conf.d/_repo/`. That folder is no longer seeded, and the tool folders override it. The plan already logs this as gap G1, but no unit owns the file.
- **The dev rule on `default_envs` is only checked for selected tools.** A bootstrap tool without dev slips past this repo's own test and fails the sync of every consumer that later selects it.

The docs that still name `_repo` (finding 7) are planned for the pending units U5 and U6, so that finding is about the state of the branch now. As the review mode asked, I did not verify these findings.

